#: includes/settings-fields.php:1366
msgid "Where the thumbnails sit while there are too few to fill the strip."
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-fields.php:1372
#: includes/settings-fields.php:1632
msgid "Gap to the slider (px)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-fields.php:1384
msgid "Thumbnails per view"
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-fields.php:1391
msgid "Sets the thumbnail size: this many fill the strip. With more slides the strip scrolls."
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-fields.php:1399
msgid "Thumbnail height (px)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-fields.php:1408
msgid "Auto (empty or 0): the size comes from Thumbnails per view and the proportions. Set: thumbnails this tall, frame included; their width follows from the proportions and as many show as fit, the rest scroll."
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-fields.php:1414
msgid "Space between thumbnails (px)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-fields.php:1427
msgid "Thumbnail proportions"
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-fields.php:1432
msgid "Square (1:1)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-fields.php:1439
msgid "The images are cropped or shown whole per “Image fit”."
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-fields.php:1485
msgid "Frame"
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-fields.php:1516
msgid "Active color"
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-fields.php:1524
msgid "Inactive thumbnail opacity (%)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-fields.php:1550
msgid "For the captions of all slides. A slide with a font size of its own (its Edit window) keeps that one. Empty: 16px."
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-fields.php:1563
msgid "Text direction"
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-fields.php:1568
msgid "Vertical, top to bottom"
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-fields.php:1569
msgid "Vertical, bottom to top"
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-fields.php:1571
msgid "Vertical text runs along the left edge of the image."
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-fields.php:1584
msgid "Background style"
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-fields.php:1588
msgid "Gradient (fades out)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-fields.php:1589
msgid "Solid"
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-fields.php:1591
msgid "The gradient runs from the image edge where the text is."
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-fields.php:1596
msgid "Background color"
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-fields.php:1602
msgid "Text shadow"
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-fields.php:1605
msgid "Keeps the text readable on light images, e.g. without a background."
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-fields.php:1618
msgid "Text transition"
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-fields.php:1622
msgid "As the slider"
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-fields.php:1627
msgid "As the slider: the text moves the way the slides do (slides, turns with a cube, flips...), at the same speed, once a slide is let go."
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-fields.php:1639
msgid "Under the slider and its pagination, if that is outside."
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-fields.php:1643
msgid "Own text color"
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-fields.php:1646
msgid "Off: the colour of the page’s text."
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-fields.php:1661
msgid "Play automatically"
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-fields.php:1664
msgid "When its slide is shown. Browsers only start a video by themselves without sound, so a video with sound starts muted."
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-fields.php:1669
msgid "Muted"
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-fields.php:1672
msgid "Without sound at first; with Show controls the visitor can turn it on."
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-fields.php:1677
msgid "Loop"
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-fields.php:1680
msgid "Starts over at the end while its slide is shown."
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-fields.php:1685
