#: includes/settings-fields.php:1746
msgid "Use as background"
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-fields.php:1749
msgid "The slider fills the block with the class below, behind its content, and plays on its own: Autoplay and Infinite loop are on; arrows, pagination, keyboard, slide links, captions, descriptions, the lightbox and Height are not used, the images are cropped to fill."
